OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening and night with a few
OL,7,Flight showers, these mainly in the
OL,8,Feast. Any cloud breaks across the west
OL,9,Fwill lead to patchy frost and fog.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FLittle change, remaining
OL,12,Frather cloudy with a few light
OL,13,Fshowers, these mainly in the east.
OL,14,FBrighter spells across the west.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,17,Fwith a few light showers on Saturday
OL,18,Fand early Sunday. Otherwise becoming
OL,19,Fdry and partly cloudy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
